<section #ag-book-part | `<book-part>`>

Compiles to eHTML `<book-part>`.

<code-block #code:ag-book-part-1>
<chapter | Origins>
Content of the chapter.
</code-block>

*(Rendered preview omitted — a book (`<meta type=book>` / `<chapter>`) is a whole-document structure, which a sealed preview box cannot host.)*

